Orcas are large toothed whales which live in [[Deep Water|Very Deep Ocean]]. They can spawn solo or in pods of 2-4.

To butcher a creature, you must first tow it to the [[Knarr]] or [[Snekkja]] and take it to the shore, secondly drag on the ground with the help of a horse.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Orcas are aggressive, and will likely engage in combat with nearby players. Aggroing any one orca will cause the entire pod to also engage.

